  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the lentils and drain well.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional 1 minute.",
    "Add the chopped carrots, cumin, paprika, salt, and black pepper, and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Stir in the tomato paste and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the lentils and water to the pot, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 30 minutes, or until the lentils are tender.",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with fresh herbs if desired, in a bamboo tray."
